  "summary": "Queries Huawei Cloud storage resources (EVS/OBS/SFS/CBR). Covers cloud disks (volumes/snapshots/types/quotas/recycle bin), OBS buckets (ACL/metadata/notifications/policies/objects), SFS Turbo file systems (shares/perm rules/backend targets/quotas/LDAP/AD), and CBR backups (vaults/policies/backups/tasks/agents/protectables). No write operations. Use this skill when the user needs to query disk info, list buckets/objects, check file system status, or view backup/policy details. Triggers: \u4e91\u786c\u76d8, EVS, \u5bf9\u8c61\u5b58\u50a8, OBS, \u6587\u4ef6\u7cfb\u7edf, SFS, \u590722\u4efd, CBR, \u5b58\u50a8\u5e93, \u5feb\u7167, \u6876, volume, bucket, backup, vault.",
